  "info": {
    "contact": {
      "name": "OVMS Karto",
      "url": "https://github.com/openvehicles/Open-Vehicle-Monitoring-System-3"
    },
    "description": "\nKarto is a trip tracking and analysis service for vehicles monitored via\n[OVMS (Open Vehicle Monitoring System)](https://www.openvehicles.com/).\n\nIt ingests GPS and telemetry data from MQTT, assembles them into discrete trips,\nand exposes them through this REST API.\n\n## Authentication\n\nAll endpoints require authentication via one of:\n- **JWT cookie** \u2013 issued by the OVMS web UI (cookie name `ovms_session`)\n- **API key** \u2013 passed in the `X-API-Key` request header\n\nBoth methods are validated against the OVMS user database.\n\n## Units\n\nUnless noted otherwise, all source data from MQTT is metric:\n- Distances: **km** (plus `_miles` variants)\n- Speeds: **km/h** (plus `_mph` variants)\n- Energy: **kWh**\n- Consumption: **kWh/100 km** (plus `_per_100mi` variants)\n\n## Data model\n\nA **Trip** begins when `v.e.on=1` is received together with a first GPS fix, and ends\nafter a configurable grace period once `v.e.on=0` is received. Trips shorter than\n`KARTO_TRIP_MIN_DISTANCE_KM` are automatically discarded.\n",
    "title": "Karto Trip Service",
    "version": "1.1.0"
  },
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "paths": {
    "/api/karto/v1/maps/{filename}": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Serves a specific map image after verifying ownership.\nThe filename is expected to be in the format: {VEHICLE_ID}_{TRIP_ID}.png",
        "operationId": "get_map_image_api_karto_v1_maps__filename__get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "filename",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "title": "Filename",
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "APIKeyHeader": []
          }
        ],
        "summary": "Serve trip map preview",
        "tags": [
          "Karto API",
          "Trips"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/karto/v1/trips/search": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Searches for trips based on geographic criteria for all vehicles owned by the user.\n\n**Search Modes:**\n1.  **Proximity (Circle):** Provide `lat`, `lon`, and `radius_m`.\n    - `relation`: `starts_within_radius` or `ends_within_radius`.\n    - Results are sorted by distance from the search point.\n2.  **Bounding Box:** Provide `bbox` as a comma-separated string.\n    - `relation`: `starts_within_bbox` or `ends_within_bbox`.",
        "operationId": "search_trips_by_location_api_karto_v1_trips_search_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
